= Instructions

Add @Pisco{2 oz}, freshly squeezed @Lime juice{1 oz}, @Simple syrup{1/2 oz} and @Egg white{1} 
into a #Cocktail shaker{} and dry-shake (without ice) vigorously.

Add @Ice{} and shake again until well-chilled.

Strain into a chilled #Nick & Nora glass{}. (Alternatively, strain it into a #Rocks glass{} over fresh @Ice{})

Garnish with @Angostura bitters{3-5 drops}.
Using a straw, toothpick or similar implement, swirl the bitters into a simple design, if desired.